ttps://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13248_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-18T12:36:54-07:00","id":1549413,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aspel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1512792-stv-pretty-guardian-faerie-knights#post1512792\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've finally gone and published my first Storyteller's Vault product: The <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Bishoujo Senshi Yosei Kishi</a>, or Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights.<br /> <br /> They're a Changeling focused Conspiracy that actually makes bargains with what they call the Seelie Fae in order to take on the blessings of Pactio and fight monsters.<br /> <br /> They're magical girls in the Chronicles of Darkness and their themes blend the inherent despair of the neverending Vigil with an optimism and hope for the future.</div> </div> </div> </div>I could've sworn I read this back in 2016 or so... did you publish it for the first time, or you have shown it before?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11880-dark-archon","name":"Dark Archon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11880_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-26T02:09:48-07:00","id":1551291,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dark Archon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1512792-stv-pretty-guardian-faerie-knights?p=1549413#post1549413\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I could've sworn I read this back in 2016 or so...</div> </div> </div> </div>I had a very unpolished concept version kicking around for quite a while, but with 2e Hunter a thing now instead of just a 1.5, I decided to dust it off and actually publish it. You can actually find the earlier version <a href=\"https://vindae.tumblr.com/post/123476195745/magicalgirls\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, which is from the distant year of 2015. And even then it was at least the second attempt at it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","name":"Aspel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-26T11:48:55-07:00","id":1551296,"title":"","content":"I love this product; though I personally treat them as a variation of the Fae-Touched from <b>Changeling</b> rather than as a Hunter &quot;Conspiracy&quot;. It just feels like a more natural fit.<br /> <br /> (In a similar way, I'd be inclined to take the <b>Hunter 1e</b> &quot;Cainite Heresy&quot; and &quot;Les Myst\u00e8res&quot; Conspiracies and remake them as variants of <b>VtR 2e</b>'s ghouls and <b>WtF 2e</b>'s wolf-blooded, respectively. Basically, any Hunter group that seems to partake of the powers of another gameline feel more like they ought to be variants of the &quot;lesser templates&quot; associated with those gamelines.)<br /> <br /> The other way I'd consider doing it would be as an Acanthus Proximus Dynasty. Given how <b>Mage 2e</b>'s Supernal World is an overlay of the Fallen World, that would make that version of Faerie Knights deal with a &quot;Dark Forest&quot; that's more like the chimerical world of <b>Changeling: the Dreaming</b> than the otherworldly realm of <b>Changeling: the Lost</b>'s Hedge. That might be more helpful in crossover games where the Dark Forest might otherwise get sidelined. And if you still want the CtL-style Hedge, remember that Supernal Arcadian symbols aren't exclusive to the material world, and might even be stronger and/or more common in the Hedge\u2026","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 05-26-2025, 02:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}